IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. FEECLAC.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       COPY TXNREC.
       01 WS-AMOUNT PIC S9(9)V99 COMP-3.
       01 WS-FEE PIC S9(7)V99 COMP-3.
       LINKAGE SECTION.
       01 LK-TXN PIC X(100).
       01 LK-RC PIC S9(4) COMP.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION USING LK-TXN LK-RC.
       MAIN.
           MOVE 0 TO LK-RC
           MOVE TXN-AMOUNT TO WS-AMOUNT
           IF WS-AMOUNT > 10000.00 COMPUTE WS-FEE ROUNDED = WS-AMOUNT * 0.015
           ELSE COMPUTE WS-FEE ROUNDED = WS-AMOUNT * 0.010 END-IF
           GOBACK.
